Many thanks for all your replies.

Most concise replies from Jeff Payne & Theodore.A.Neuville

******  You must have in /usr/include /usr/lib the following files:
                                   libwrap.a
                                   tcpd.h
If these files are missing, the configure script fails. This happens
because the Wrappers install script tides up these files but are required
now to configure openSSH for Wrapper support.

I had installed tcpwrappers but libwrap.a was not placed in /usr/lib
Many thanks, all is now well.
