WOW...what a lot of responses. I really appreciate the help.  There were =
a ton of suggestions, and a couple of contradictions:
These are the top recommended training places:

www.softadv.com
www.mindiq.com
www.bruden.com
www.globalknowledge.com
www.parsec.com

A ton of people recommend bruden and mindiq, with globalknowledge coming =
in third.  Some people said that gobal knowledge was bought out by =
bruden, and others say global knowledge was bought out by mindiq.  I =
will do some research on these companies.  Thanks again for the ton of =
responses. =3D)

Of course...one person suggested that compaq employees were going to =
start going to HP for training. ;)

Jonathan Williams
