this.
Interestingly tests such as 
/new/sendmail -C/new/sendmail/sendmail.cf -d21.12
user@A worked, so it suggested that pine and dtmail
where not using the right config file, and i had to go
on a hunt for it.

This opens a new question, as to how else could dtmail
be set to look somewhere else for sendmail.cf?
Since sendmails default (as of 12.3) is /etc/mail, the
only way out is a link, right? (probably easier)

Thanks to John Venier, Mike Hutchson, Lucio Chiapetti
and Anthony Talltree for their suggestions and time.

