 Thanks to Erenst LaBonte for this answer.

 here is his reponse:

Most of the printcap options are not available when using an lpd                                                                                      
remote (rm/rp) printcap entry. The printcap entry needs to be                                                                                         
converted to use tcp/ip printing.                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                      
bertabin3:\                                                                                                                                           
        :if=/usr/lbin/ppdof +OOutputBin=bin3 +OPageSize=A4 +Chplj8150.rpd:\                                                                           
        :lf=/usr/adm/lp2err:\                                                                                                                         
        :lp=@berta.nic.fr/port_9100:\                                                                                                                 
        :mx#0:\                                                                                                                                       
        :of=/usr/lbin/ppdof +OOutputBin=bin3 +OPageSize=A4 +Chplj8150.rpd:\                                                                           
        :pl#66:\                                                                                                                                      
        :pw#0:\                                                                                                                                       
        :rw:\                                                                                                                                         
        :sd=/usr/spool/lpd2:\                                                                                                                         
        :xf=/usr/lbin/xf:                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                      
Edit the file /etc/services and add the following entry:                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                      
        port_9100       9100/tcp        # Printer socket number          


 the solution was to use the lp option not the (rm/rp) options



