Lot of people responded .
The way out is to define in smb.conf file
[global]
 max open files = 4086
Also I had hit a bug on samba-2.2.3a , I had to upgrade to 2.2.4 (it has
been running for 10 hrs no problems).
Thanks to  Rob  and Dr. Blinn for giving me the solution.

Cheers
yogesh


