Ashraf Baker suggested running lprsetup and specifying on for 'sb' 
and 'sh' to on.  Doing this solved the problem.

I got several other suggestions to simply put  :sh: into the 
printcap, with no value.  Looking at what lprsetup did to my printcap 
this appears to be exactly what it did:

  3.418_lw:\
	<other stuff deleted>
	:sb:\
	:sh:

thanks for the help.
