As part of our effort to converge the best features of Tru64UNIX and HP-UX,
we would like to hear from users of both what you like about each OS. Please
spend a few minutes to answer the simple questions below. Be as detailed as
possible. We appreciate your feedback. It is extremely valuable to us as we
plan the converged UNIX.

1) what features of Tru64UNIX do you like best?


2) what features of HP-UX do you like best?


